      "text": "Breakfast and check-out.\n Private transfer to The Grand Hotel Punta del Este.\n In the afternoon:\n\nPrivate Punta del Este City Tour (Includes CasaPueblo Entrance)\n Visit the commercial center of the Peninsula, Craft Market, Yacht Port, the Church of Nuestra Señora de la Candelaria, \"Four Seas\" corner, lighthouse, and the “La Mano” sculpture.\n Continue through the residential districts with beautiful gardens and luxurious summer homes: La Barra, the famous wavy bridges, Parque Indígena, El Jagüel, Beverly Hills, Lugano, and Cantegril.\n The final stop is the Casapueblo Museum & Workshop of renowned Uruguayan artist Carlos Páez Vilaró, where you will experience the famous Punta Ballena sunset accompanied by a glass of champagne.\n Return to the hotel. Overnight in Punta del Este."
    },
